{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_988.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"37a1438770f05bbcb47b4307fc05b8d5b81ce1e1b44f140822c1f90df85c8a44","ja":"待たせたわね、環！　劇の内容、私なりに\n環にもわかりやすいようにまとめてきたわよ。","zh":"让你久等了，环！我按照自己的方式把剧本内容整理了一下，让环也能看懂。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_988.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"4dfe04007206a335b6f5d94d4e844f87b30d673f61d3136b33ce7eb0f542d998","ja":"はい、レジュメ！\n……じゃなくて。ええと……はい、プリントね。","zh":"好的，简历！\n……不对。呃……给，这是讲义。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_988.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"822e0723092b1d6605ed4eac602f7ba47e39d02f5cdab122af425191edb3c8a1","ja":"わあっ、なんか学校みたいだね！\nありがとう、りつこ～♪","zh":"哇，感觉好像学校一样呢！\n谢谢你，律子～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_988.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"7236b021307cc84cc895f5318668e6d893b1ab5c1c3a17ced9ff68f2c1d4046b","ja":"あ、ふたりともここにいたんだねぇ。\n探したよぉ。","zh":"啊，原来你们两个都在这里呀。\n我找了你们好久。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_988.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"3fb643a5200ec0f856062b85255c25d8d3a3cc6e11cb51fa7bd537727d63aa2f","ja":"お菓子をもらったの。よかったら、\nみんなで食べようと思って。……あら？","zh":"我拿到了一些点心。要是不介意的话，想和大家一起吃。……哎呀？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_988.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"842c455142469a9ee3dd9ab311130620ecfa20e98aad54c907a0e1954f74e20b","ja":"あれ、そのプリントって、何？\n……あ、もしかして環、宿題中やった！？","zh":"咦，那张资料是什么？\n……啊，难道环刚才在写作业！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_988.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"f8235444ff796f574ddd79002f91d759626ef0994e0525482818219e59c731e3","ja":"ふふ、気にしないで！\nむしろ、タイミングバッチリよ♪","zh":"呵呵，别在意！\n反而是时机刚刚好♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_988.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"f2dda7c27f847c1a60f59301ecec6f1fc44721323833dfa6c9ebc97cdaa391c9","ja":"劇のお話のこと、これからりつこに教えてもらうんだ！\nみんなも一緒に勉強しよ！","zh":"关于戏剧的内容，接下来要让律子教我啦！  \n大家也一起来学习吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_988.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"dfb2e874515984043fe2b5841dbc8e242c14a53ccf2c8f3423497913bca0ff1c","ja":"そういうこと。環が劇の内容をちゃんと\n把握したいって言ってたんで。","zh":"就是这么回事。因为环说她想好好了解戏剧的内容。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_988.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"9db07bf1398a10b431caa55715679a7aaaeaf5e70371078db8b81650ef02d41b","ja":"内容の解説だけじゃなくって、物語が\n生まれた背景まで、しっかり説明してあげますよ！","zh":"不仅会讲解内容，就连故事诞生的背景，我也会好好说明给你听！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_988.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"c826cbcd23d4d1e5f886813876766c34704501b5176aae5f3143d7566a6f3a12","ja":"うわ～、めっちゃ助かるわ！　実は私も\n心配で心配で……！　今回の劇、難しいな～って！","zh":"哇～真是帮大忙了！其实我也\n一直担心得不得了……！这次的剧目，我觉得好难啊～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_988.unity3d","item_key":"commands[41].text","source_sha256":"a2ad4efbc281de4a46319adde2703e9c72ca0124e9dd6dbdf9a93c1e87d1b5a2","ja":"あたしも不安だったんだ。\n『村長』なんて大それた役になってしまったし……。","zh":"我也感到不安。\n毕竟竟然成了“村长”这么不得了的角色……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_988.unity3d","item_key":"commands[42].text","source_sha256":"ebc1e8fd7b633a86c077c8aabaffb6df892f72170b3c6a11479f2d5c82f59b7c","ja":"あたしが村長って、\nなにをすればいいんだろうかって。","zh":"我当村长的话，该做些什么才好呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_988.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"13ae004eb806af8e3bde0fb8a650c47989c04fbb84324ea84ca10fe397d269c7","ja":"私も、解釈に悩んでるところがあったの。\n一緒にお勉強させてちょうだい！","zh":"我也有为该怎么理解而烦恼的地方。\n请让我和你一起学习吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_988.unity3d","item_key":"commands[44].text","source_sha256":"7ddbd4b12e1f6e8058ebbf0ef54f5408610801e53a4239ff9d7385349657530f","ja":"律子ちゃん、ご指導ご鞭撻よろしくね♪","zh":"律子，今后请多多指导♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
